   "ruling": "Ruling: model error; project retained. Follows from the model's method: it applied Table A-5 (150% DB, mid-quarter, fourth quarter, 15-year, year 1 1.25%) to $18,751.20, but qualified improvement property is GDS straight line (p946 Table 4-1, \"GDS using SL ... Qualified improvement property ... placed in service after 2017\"); Table A-12 (Straight Line Method, Mid-Quarter Convention, Placed in Service in Fourth Quarter), 15 years, year 1, is 0.83%, and $18,751.20 x 0.83% = $155.63, the project's amount. Both sides agree on the basis ($18,751.20, 19(c)) and the fourth-quarter convention. Not evidence. [dropped]"
